{"unit_id":"tag:0GJ1:statement","translation":"考虑笛卡尔（cartesian）图表（diagram），其各项为概形（schemes）\n<MATH_0001>\n其中<MATH_0002>有限（finite），且<MATH_0003>为开浸入（open immersion）。则<MATH_0004>，作为函子（functors）\n<MATH_0005>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0GJ1:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为对象（object），属于<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>为几何点（geometric point），位于<MATH_0004>上，不属于开集（open）<MATH_0005>。则\n<MATH_0006>\n由命题<REF_0001>，并且因为茎（stalk），对于<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>处而言，由引理<REF_0002>为零。另一方面，由引理<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>，有\n<MATH_0009>。\n因此，由刻画<MATH_0010>的引理<REF_0005>可知<MATH_0011>。我们略去该对应对<MATH_0012>具有函子性（functorial）的验证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集"},{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
