{"unit_id":"tag:05BE:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>可构造（constructible）的局部闭子概形（closed subscheme）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，属于<MATH_0002>，是局部闭子概形（closed subscheme）<MATH_0003>，使得底层拓扑空间（topological space），对于<MATH_0004>而言，是可构造（constructible）子集（subset），属于<MATH_0005>。若<MATH_0006>为局部闭子概形（closed subschemes），其底层拓扑空间（topological space）相同，则<MATH_0007>，由拓扑不变性（topological invariance），对于平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）位点（site）而言（定理<REF_0001>）。因此，在以下定义中，我们可以假设所用的局部闭子概形（closed subschemes）约化（reduced）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"topological invariance","target_term":"拓扑不变性"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"局部闭子概形","context":"原文以 locally 修饰；暂译。"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形","context":"原文以 locally 修饰；暂译。"},{"source_term":"topological invariance","target_term":"拓扑不变性","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"r